---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MiniLessonPreview from '../components/home/MiniLessonPreview.astro';
---

<Layout title="Languago — İngilizce için net bir sonraki adım" description="İngilizce öğrenmek için seviyeni gör, kısa bir ders dene ve kendine uygun yoldan devam et.">
  <main class="home-page">
    <section class="home-hero container" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="home-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">İngilizce öğrenmek için sade bir başlangıç</p>
        <h1 id="home-title">Bugün ne çalışacağını bil.</h1>
        <p class="home-hero__lead">Seviyeni tahmin etmek yerine kısa bir testle başla. Sonra dil bilgisi, kelime ve okuma çalışmalarını tek bir öğrenme yolunda sırala.</p>
        <div class="home-actions" aria-label="Ana işlemler">
          <a class="home-button home-button--primary" href="#level-test">Seviyeni gör</a>
          <a class="home-button home-button--quiet" href="/ogren">Öğrenme yolunu incele</a>
        </div>
        <p class="home-trust">Kısa adımlar · Açık geri bildirim · Resmi sınav yerine başlangıç tahmini</p>
      </div>
      <MiniLessonPreview />
    </section>

    <section class="audience container" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Sana göre bir akış</p>
        <h2 id="audience-title">İhtiyacın değişirse yolun da değişsin.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="audience-switch" role="tablist" aria-label="Kullanım amacı seç">
        <button class="audience-switch__button is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-audience="learner">Öğrenciyim</button>
        <button class="audience-switch__button" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-audience="teacher">Öğretmenim</button>
      </div>
      <div class="audience-card" data-audience-panel="learner">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">Öğrenci akışı</span><h3>Bir sonraki çalışmayı seçmek kolay olsun.</h3><p>Seviye testinden sonra önerilen başlangıç konunu aç, kısa pratik yap ve kelimeleri tekrar et. Nerede kaldığını panelinden takip edebilirsin.</p></div>
        <a class="home-button home-button--primary" href="/ogren">Öğrenmeye başla <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="audience-card" data-audience-panel="teacher" hidden>
        <div><span class="eyebrow">Öğretmen akışı</span><h3>Ders öncesi hazırlığı tek yerde toparla.</h3><p>Seviye ve konuya göre materyal taslağı oluştur, öğrenci kopyasını cevap anahtarından ayrı tut ve öğretmen paneline geç.</p></div>
        <a class="home-button home-button--primary" href="/materyal-uretici">Materyal üreticiyi aç <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="placement-section container" aria-labelledby="placement-title" id="level-test">
      <div class="placement-card">
        <div class="placement-card__intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Başlangıç noktan</p>
          <h2 id="placement-title">İngilizce seviyeni tahmin etmeyelim.</h2>
          <p>A1’den C2’ye ilerleyen kısa seviye testi, verdiğin yanıtlara göre sıradaki soruyu seçer. Sonuç resmi sınav değildir; nereden başlaman gerektiğine dair bir çalışma tahminidir.</p>
          <div class="placement-levels" aria-label="CEFR seviyeleri"><span>A1</span><span>A2</span><span>B1</span><span>B2</span><span>C1</span><span>C2</span></div>
          <div class="placement-profile" aria-labelledby="placement-profile-title">
            <h3 id="placement-profile-title">Önce öğrenciyi tanıyalım</h3>
            <div class="placement-fields">
              <label for="placement-name">Öğrencinin adı</label>
              <input id="placement-name" name="placement-name" maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Örn. Deniz" />
              <label for="placement-goal">Ne için hazırlanıyor?</label>
              <select id="placement-goal" name="placement-goal">
                <option value="general">Genel İngilizce</option><option value="ielts">IELTS</option><option value="toefl">TOEFL</option><option value="yds">YDS / YÖKDİL</option><option value="other">Diğer sınav / hedef</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <p class="placement-note">En az 30 soru sorulur. Doğru cevaplarda seviye yükselir, yanlış cevaplarda daha temel bir maddeye dönülür.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="placement-actions"><button class="home-button home-button--primary" type="button" id="placement-start" disabled>Seviye analizini başlat</button><button class="home-button home-button--quiet placement-resume" type="button" id="placement-resume" hidden>Teste devam et</button></div>
          <p class="placement-note">30–40 soru · Yanıtların bu cihazda taslak olarak saklanabilir.</p>
          <p class="placement-feedback" id="placement-load-error" role="alert"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="placement-test" id="placement-test" hidden>
          <div class="placement-test__topline"><span id="placement-step">Soru 1</span><span class="placement-current" id="placement-current">A1</span></div>
          <div class="placement-progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="Seviye testi ilerlemesi" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="40" aria-valuenow="0"><span id="placement-progress-bar"></span></div>
          <p class="placement-source" id="placement-source"></p>
          <section class="placement-passage" id="placement-passage" aria-labelledby="placement-passage-label" hidden>
            <h3 id="placement-passage-label" tabindex="-1">Okuma metni</h3>
            <p id="placement-passage-title" lang="en"></p>
            <div id="placement-passage-text" lang="en"></div>
          </section>
          <h3 id="placement-question" lang="en" tabindex="-1"></h3>
          <div class="placement-options" id="placement-options" role="group" aria-label="Cevap seçenekleri"></div>
          <p class="placement-feedback" id="placement-feedback" aria-live="polite"></p><button class="home-button home-button--quiet" type="button" id="placement-next" hidden>Sonraki soru</button>
        </div>
        <div class="placement-result" id="placement-result" hidden>
          <p class="eyebrow">İlk profilin hazır</p><h3 id="placement-result-title"></h3><p id="placement-result-copy"></p>
          <div class="placement-result__stats" id="placement-result-stats" aria-label="Seviye testi özeti"></div>
          <p class="placement-result__next" id="placement-result-next"></p><p class="placement-save" id="placement-save" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <div class="placement-actions"><a class="home-button home-button--primary" href="/signup?from=placement">Yolunu kaydet</a><button class="home-button home-button--quiet" type="button" id="placement-restart">Testi yeniden başlat</button></div>
          <p class="placement-note">Hesabın varsa <a href="/signin?from=placement">giriş yap</a>; sonucu hesabına aktarabilirsin.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="coverage container" aria-labelledby="coverage-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Çalışma alanları</p><h2 id="coverage-title">Tek bir hedefe değil, gerçek ihtiyacına çalış.</h2></div>
      <div class="coverage-grid">
        <a class="coverage-card" href="/dashboard/dilbilgisi"><span class="coverage-card__number">01</span><h3>Dil bilgisi</h3><p>A1–C1 konuları, örnekler ve pekiştirme soruları.</p><span class="coverage-card__link">Dersleri gör →</span></a>
        <a class="coverage-card" href="/dashboard/kelimeler"><span class="coverage-card__number">02</span><h3>Kelime</h3><p>Bağlam içinde kelime, yazım pratiği ve tekrar.</p><span class="coverage-card__link">Kelime çalış →</span></a>
        <a class="coverage-card" href="/dashboard/okuma"><span class="coverage-card__number">03</span><h3>Okuma</h3><p>A1–C2 ve sınav odaklı metinlerle anlama pratiği.</p><span class="coverage-card__link">Metinleri aç →</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  import { createPlacementState, getPlacementPassage, placementResult, recordPlacementAnswer, selectNextPlacementQuestion, shouldFinishPlacement } from '../lib/placement-test.mjs';
  const $ = (selector) => document.querySelector(selector);
  const startButton = $('#placement-start'); const resumeButton = $('#placement-resume'); const testPanel = $('#placement-test'); const resultPanel = $('#placement-result'); const intro = document.querySelector('.placement-card__intro');
  const questionEl = $('#placement-question'); const optionsEl = $('#placement-options'); const feedbackEl = $('#placement-feedback'); const nextButton = $('#placement-next'); const stepEl = $('#placement-step'); const currentEl = $('#placement-current'); const sourceEl = $('#placement-source'); const progressBar = $('#placement-progress-bar'); const progress = document.querySelector('.placement-progress'); const saveEl = $('#placement-save'); const resultTitle = $('#placement-result-title'); const resultCopy = $('#placement-result-copy'); const resultStats = $('#placement-result-stats'); const resultNext = $('#placement-result-next'); const restartButton = $('#placement-restart'); const nameInput = $('#placement-name'); const goalInput = $('#placement-goal'); const draftKey = 'languago:placement-draft';
  const passageEl = $('#placement-passage'); const passageLabel = $('#placement-passage-label'); const passageTitle = $('#placement-passage-title'); const passageText = $('#placement-passage-text'); const loadError = $('#placement-load-error');
  let pool = []; let passages = {}; let state = createPlacementState(); let currentQuestion = null;
  const setText = (element, value) => { if (element) element.textContent = value; };
  function profile() { return { learnerName: String(nameInput?.value || '').trim().slice(0, 120), goal: String(goalInput?.value || 'general') }; }
  function saveDraft() { try { localStorage.setItem(draftKey, JSON.stringify({ ...profile(), answers: state.questions })); } catch { setText(saveEl, 'Taslak bu cihazda saklanamadı; teste devam edebilirsin.'); } }
  async function checkAnswer(id, selectedIndex) { const response = await fetch('/api/placement/check', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ id, selectedIndex }) }); if (!response.ok) throw new Error('check'); return response.json(); }
  async function replayDraft(draft) { let replayed = createPlacementState(draft || {}); for (const row of (draft?.answers || []).slice(0, 40)) { const question = pool.find((item) => item.id === row.id); if (!question) continue; const checked = await checkAnswer(question.id, row.selectedIndex); replayed = recordPlacementAnswer(replayed, question, Boolean(checked.correct), row.selectedIndex); } return replayed; }
  function readDraft() { try { const draft = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(draftKey) || 'null'); return Array.isArray(draft?.answers) && draft.answers.length ? draft : null; } catch { try { localStorage.removeItem(draftKey); } catch {} return null; } }
  function clearDraft() { try { localStorage.removeItem(draftKey); } catch {} }
  function renderPassage() {
    const passage = getPlacementPassage(currentQuestion, passages);
    if (!passageEl || !passageText) return;
    passageEl.hidden = !passage;
    setText(passageTitle, passage?.title || '');
    passageText.replaceChildren();
    // Plain text only: keep the source's paragraph breaks, never interpret HTML.
    for (const text of passage?.text.split(/\r?\n\s*\r?\n/) || []) {
      const paragraph = document.createElement('p');
      paragraph.textContent = text;
      passageText.append(paragraph);
    }
    (passage ? passageLabel : questionEl)?.focus();
  }
  function renderResultStats(result) { if (!resultStats) return; resultStats.innerHTML = ''; [[`${result.accuracy}%`, 'genel doğruluk'], [`${result.correctAnswers}/${result.questionsAnswered}`, 'doğru cevap'], [result.estimatedScore == null ? result.level : result.estimatedScore, result.scoreLabel]].forEach(([value, label]) => { const item = document.createElement('div'); item.className = 'placement-stat'; const strong = document.createElement('strong'); strong.textContent = value; const span = document.createElement('span'); span.textContent = label; item.append(strong, span); resultStats.append(item); }); }
  async function saveResult() { setText(saveEl, 'Sonucun hesabına kaydediliyor…'); try { const response = await fetch('/api/placement/save', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ ...profile(), answers: state.questions }) }); if (!response.ok) throw new Error('save'); clearDraft(); setText(saveEl, 'Sonuç kaydedildi. Öğrenme yolun hazır.'); } catch { setText(saveEl, 'Sonuç bu cihazda tutuldu. Hesabına aktarmak için giriş yapıp testi yeniden açabilirsin.'); } }
  function showResult() { const result = placementResult(state); testPanel.hidden = true; resultPanel.hidden = false; setText(resultTitle, `${result.learnerName ? `${result.learnerName}, ` : ''}tahmini seviyen: ${result.level}`); setText(resultCopy, `${result.goalLabel} için ${result.questionsAnswered} soruda %${result.accuracy} doğruluk. Bu skor resmi sınav sonucu değildir; öğrenme başlangıcı için gerçekçi bir tahmindir.`); renderResultStats(result); setText(resultNext, `Önerilen ilk adım: ${result.level} seviyesindeki temel konularla başla, ardından kısa bir okuma ve kelime çalışmasıyla sonucu doğrula.`); void saveResult(); }
  function renderQuestion() { if (shouldFinishPlacement(state)) return showResult(); currentQuestion = selectNextPlacementQuestion({ state, pool }); if (!currentQuestion) return showResult(); setText(stepEl, `Soru ${state.questions.length + 1}`); setText(currentEl, currentQuestion.level); setText(sourceEl, currentQuestion.source === 'reading' ? 'Okuma ve anlam' : currentQuestion.source === 'vocabulary' ? 'Kelime ve anlam' : 'Dil bilgisi'); setText(questionEl, currentQuestion.prompt); renderPassage(); setText(feedbackEl, ''); nextButton.hidden = true; optionsEl.innerHTML = ''; currentQuestion.options.forEach((option, index) => { const button = document.createElement('button'); button.type = 'button'; button.className = 'placement-option'; button.textContent = option; button.addEventListener('click', () => answer(index, button)); optionsEl.append(button); }); const percent = Math.min(100, (state.questions.length / 40) * 100); progressBar.style.width = `${percent}%`; progress?.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', String(state.questions.length)); }
  async function answer(index, selectedButton) { if (!currentQuestion || state.questions.some((row) => row.id === currentQuestion.id)) return; optionsEl.querySelectorAll('button').forEach((button) => { button.disabled = true; }); setText(feedbackEl, 'Cevabın değerlendiriliyor…'); try { const checked = await checkAnswer(currentQuestion.id, index); const correct = Boolean(checked.correct); state = recordPlacementAnswer(state, currentQuestion, correct, index); selectedButton.classList.add(correct ? 'is-correct' : 'is-wrong'); if (!correct) optionsEl.children[checked.correctIndex]?.classList.add('is-correct'); setText(feedbackEl, correct ? 'Doğru. Bir sonraki soru buna göre seçiliyor.' : (checked.why || 'Bu cevap hedef seviyeyi yeniden ayarladı.')); saveDraft(); nextButton.hidden = false; if (shouldFinishPlacement(state)) setText(nextButton, 'Sonucu gör'); } catch { setText(feedbackEl, 'Cevap doğrulanamadı. Bağlantını kontrol edip tekrar dene.'); optionsEl.querySelectorAll('button').forEach((button) => { button.disabled = false; }); } }
  async function startTest(resume = false) {
    startButton.disabled = true; resumeButton.disabled = true;
    setText(loadError, ''); setText(startButton, 'Soru havuzu hazırlanıyor…');
    try {
      // Invalidate cached answer keys after the A1 subject-agreement correction.
      const response = await fetch('/api/placement/pool?v=3');
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error('pool');
      const data = await response.json();
      pool = Array.isArray(data.questions) ? data.questions : [];
      passages = data.passages || {};
      if (!pool.length) throw new Error('empty');
      if (pool.some((question) => question.source === 'reading' && !getPlacementPassage(question, passages))) throw new Error('missing passage');
      state = createPlacementState(resume ? (readDraft() || profile()) : profile());
      if (resume) {
        const draft = readDraft();
        if (draft?.learnerName && nameInput) nameInput.value = draft.learnerName;
        if (draft?.goal && goalInput) goalInput.value = draft.goal;
        state = await replayDraft(draft);
        saveDraft();
      }
      intro.hidden = true; resultPanel.hidden = true; testPanel.hidden = false; renderQuestion();
    } catch {
      intro.hidden = false; testPanel.hidden = true; resultPanel.hidden = true;
      startButton.disabled = false; resumeButton.disabled = false;
      setText(startButton, 'Tekrar dene');
      setText(loadError, 'Soru havuzu veya okuma metinleri yüklenemedi. Lütfen tekrar dene.');
    }
  }
  startButton?.addEventListener('click', () => startTest(false)); resumeButton?.addEventListener('click', () => startTest(true)); nextButton?.addEventListener('click', renderQuestion); restartButton?.addEventListener('click', () => { clearDraft(); state = createPlacementState(); resultPanel.hidden = true; testPanel.hidden = true; intro.hidden = false; startButton.disabled = !String(nameInput?.value || '').trim(); setText(startButton, 'Seviye analizini başlat'); resumeButton.hidden = true; setText(saveEl, ''); }); nameInput?.addEventListener('input', () => { startButton.disabled = !String(nameInput.value || '').trim(); }); if (readDraft()) resumeButton.hidden = false;

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-audience]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => { const target = button.dataset.audience; document.querySelectorAll('[data-audience]').forEach((item) => { const active = item === button; item.classList.toggle('is-active', active); item.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active)); }); document.querySelectorAll('[data-audience-panel]').forEach((panel) => { panel.hidden = panel.dataset.audiencePanel !== target; }); }));
</script>

<style>
  .home-page { background: #fbfaf6; color: #173c3e; }
  .container { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .home-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(360px, .8fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0; color: #0b746d; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .home-hero h1 { max-width: 9ch; margin: .6rem 0 1rem; color: #123b3d; font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.9rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .home-hero__lead { max-width: 54ch; color: #526664; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.65; }
  .home-actions, .placement-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; }
  .home-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .45rem; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: .65rem; padding: .72rem 1rem; font: inherit; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .home-button--primary { background: #0b746d; color: #fff; }
  .home-button--primary:hover, .home-button--primary:focus-visible { background: #075f5a; }
  .home-button--quiet { border-color: #cfe1df; background: transparent; color: #0b635f; }
  .home-trust, .placement-note { color: #70807d; font-size: .8rem; }
  .audience, .placement-section, .coverage { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .section-heading { max-width: 660px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .section-heading h2 { margin: .45rem 0 0; color: #123b3d; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .audience-switch { display: inline-flex; gap: .2rem; border: 1px solid #dbe7e4; border-radius: 999px; padding: .25rem; background: #f3f7f3; }
  .audience-switch__button { border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: .6rem .9rem; background: transparent; color: #647572; font: inherit; font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  .audience-switch__button.is-active { background: #fff; color: #075f5a; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(21,63,63,.08); }
  .audience-card { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem; border: 1px solid #d8e6e2; border-radius: 1rem; padding: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 2rem); background: #f0f7f3; }
  .audience-card h3 { margin: .35rem 0 .45rem; color: #163f40; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem); }
  .audience-card p { max-width: 65ch; margin: 0; color: #5d716e; line-height: 1.6; }
  .placement-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .78fr) minmax(0, 1.22fr); gap: clamp(1.3rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); border: 1px solid #cfe1df; border-radius: 1.25rem; padding: clamp(1.3rem, 4vw, 3rem); background: #eef7f3; }
  .placement-card h2 { max-width: 13ch; margin: .5rem 0 .8rem; color: #123b3d; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .placement-card__intro > p:not(.eyebrow):not(.placement-note) { max-width: 52ch; color: #536765; line-height: 1.6; }
  .placement-levels { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .35rem; margin: 1.2rem 0; }
  .placement-levels span, .placement-current { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 2.15rem; border-radius: 999px; padding: .35rem .55rem; background: #dcefe8; color: #075f5a; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .placement-test, .placement-result { align-self: center; border: 1px solid #d7e5e1; border-radius: .95rem; padding: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem); background: #fffdf9; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(21,63,63,.07); }
  .placement-test__topline { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #61726f; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .placement-progress { height: .4rem; margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 999px; background: #dcefe8; }
  .placement-progress span { display: block; height: 100%; width: 0; border-radius: inherit; background: #0b8a7f; transition: width .25s ease; }
  .placement-source { margin: 0; color: #70807d; font-size: .78rem; }
  .placement-passage { margin-block: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid #0d9488; padding: .8rem 1rem; background: #f2f8f5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .placement-passage #placement-passage-label { margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: .95rem; }
  #placement-passage-title { margin: 0; color: #163f40; font-weight: 750; }
  #placement-passage-text { color: #304e4c; line-height: 1.75; }
  :global(#placement-passage-text p) { margin: .75rem 0 0; white-space: pre-line; }
  #placement-passage-label:focus-visible, #placement-question:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #0d9488; outline-offset: 4px; }
  #placement-load-error:empty { display: none; }
  .placement-test h3 { margin: .6rem 0 1rem; color: #163f40; line-height: 1.4; }
  :global(.placement-options) { display: grid; gap: .55rem; }
  :global(.placement-option) { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #cfe1df; border-radius: .7rem; padding: .75rem .9rem; background: #fff; color: #173c3e; text-align: left; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  :global(.placement-option:hover:not(:disabled)), :global(.placement-option:focus-visible) { border-color: #0b8a7f; outline: 3px solid rgba(11,138,127,.14); }
  :global(.placement-option:disabled) { cursor: default; opacity: .9; }
  :global(.placement-option.is-correct) { border-color: #0b8a7f; background: #e5f5ef; }
  :global(.placement-option.is-wrong) { border-color: #b84b35; background: #fff0eb; }
  .placement-feedback { min-height: 1.5rem; color: #536665; font-size: .86rem; }
  .placement-result { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .placement-result h3 { margin: .4rem 0; color: #123b3d; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); }
